## Weekly Threat Summary

**23 vulnerabilities** were added to the CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) catalog this period. The highest CVSS score is **10.0**.

This week includes **12 critical-severity** vulnerabilities (CVSS 9.0+) that require immediate attention.

## This Week's Vulnerabilities

